title: "SEZ Renewable Energy Dashboard"
abstract: >-
  An analytical model and interactive dashboard assessing renewable energy
  competitiveness across 81 Indonesian industrial sites — 25 Special Economic
  Zones (KEKs) plus 56 priority standalone and cluster sites spanning cement,
  steel, nickel, aluminium, and fertilizer. Computes solar and wind LCOE,
  grid integration costs, BESS storage requirements, EU CBAM exposure
  (with Energy-vs-Process emissions decomposition and RE-addressable
  fraction), and action flags for each site under user-adjustable financing
  and cost assumptions. Includes A/B scenario comparison with flip detection.
  Built for development bank analysts, energy investors, policy advisors,
  and sector decarbonization roadmap planners.
